---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Saurabh Nandwana"
  description="Story and background of Saurabh Nandwana — engineer, founder of unfoundbox, nomad in SE Asia."
>
  <div class="about-page container-narrow">
    <header class="about-header film-card">
      <div class="header-prompt">
        <span>&gt; whoami --verbose</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-header-main">
        <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt={siteConfig.author} class="about-portrait" />
        <div class="about-header-text">
          <h1 class="about-name">{siteConfig.author}</h1>
          <p class="about-tagline">{siteConfig.tagline}</p>
          <div class="about-status-row">
            <span class="vintage-tag vintage-tag-ink">Status: Building in public</span>
            <span class="vintage-tag">{siteConfig.location}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Hey there! I’m Saurabh. I’m an early-stage startup engineer and builder with a deep interest in applied machine learning, client-side WebGPU acceleration, and high-scale browser video platforms.
      </p>

      <h2>The Backstory &amp; Path</h2>
      <p>
        I grew up in a small town in Rajasthan, raised by my single mom and elder sister. In 11th grade, I fell in love with C++ programming and decided to make software my life's craft.
      </p>
      <p>
        After IIT-JEE prep in Kota and landing at BIT Bangalore for telecommunications, I realized traditional rote coursework was disconnected from the fast-evolving startup ecosystem. I took a leap, dropped out of engineering, and joined <strong>Signzy</strong> at the seed stage.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Signzy, I worked directly with the founders building digital KYC engines and real-time computer vision document extraction. Later, I joined <strong>Vectorly</strong> — an MIT Sandbox startup developing client-side neural video upscaling in WASM and WebGL. Vectorly was acqui-hired by <strong>Hopin</strong> during the height of the virtual events boom.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Hopin and <strong>StreamYard</strong>, I worked across applied ML, LLM-based smart clip detection, and WebRTC/WebCodecs broadcast infrastructure handling millions of live streams.
      </p>

      <h2>What I'm Building Now</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Katana (katana.video):</strong> Hardware-accelerated browser video super-resolution running locally via WebGPU compute shaders and WebCodecs.</li>
        <li><strong>MotionVector:</strong> Programmatic creative motion tools, video generation pipelines, and web 3D engines.</li>
        <li><strong>Lookaround (lookaround.space):</strong> Navigable 3D WebGL / Gaussian splat environments running without installation in browsers.</li>
        <li><strong>Launchy (launchy.video):</strong> Automated product launch video generation.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Digital Nomad Life</h2>
      <p>
        I spend part of each year nomading across South East Asia — living out of Bangkok, Da Nang, Koh Phangan, and my hometown of Udaipur.
      </p>

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>X (Twitter):</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.twitter} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@unfoundbox</a></li>
        <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/unfoundbox</a></li>
        <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/saurabh-nandwana</a></li>
        <li><strong>Medium:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.medium} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">medium.com/@saurabhnandwana</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3.5vw, 32px);
    background: #FAF8F5;
  }

  .header-prompt {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .about-header-main {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-portrait {
    width: 90px;
    height: 90px;
    border: 3px solid #111111;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-name {
    font-family: var(--font-typewriter-display);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .about-tagline {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .about-status-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
